SUMMARY:Wildwood (2026)
LOCATION:Moreland Theater\, 6712 SE Milwaukie Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.4752;-122.6504
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Travis Knight · 132 min\n\nPrue and her classmate Curtis 
 are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures\, loyal al
 lies\, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to r
 escue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysteri
 ous woman named Alexandra.\n\nTickets: https://morelandtheater.com/tickets
 /\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/
